  "statement": {
    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "Let E(l, m, n) be a group on generators a, b with the presentation ⟨a, b |\nal = 1, (ab)m = bn ⟩, where l, m, n satisfy 1/l + 1/m + 1/n < 1. Are there any values\nfor l, m, n such that E(l, m, n) is shortlex automatic?\n    It is known that E(6, 2, 6) is not shortlex automatic.                   C. Chalk",
